     "hint": "List every appliance that can be running when a motor starts. Fridges, freezers, pumps, washing machines, compressors and non-inverter ACs carry a starting surge; the calculator finds the largest one. Starting watts: leave it blank for an appliance picked from the list (its own starting watts are used); for a custom motor or compressor type its starting watts."
