      "name": "What are the starting watts of a refrigerator?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
       "@type": "Answer",
       "text": "About 1,200 W for a typical non-inverter fridge that runs at 200 W, and about 200 W for an inverter fridge. Your fridge's own figure may differ; type its label watts into the list."
      }
